OL,3,CHappy Birthday Beatrix Potter! 10
OL,4,Cfacts on the author's 160th birthday
OL,6,FBeatrix Potter created characters like
OL,7,FPeter Rabbit, Jemima Puddle-Duck and
OL,8,FMrs Tiggy-Winkle that have captivated
OL,9,Fchildren for generations.
OL,11,FHer works have sold over 200 million
OL,12,Fcopies worldwide and continue to prove
OL,13,Fpopular to this day.
OL,15,FBy far her most popular stories were
OL,16,Fher 23 children's tales that comprise
OL,17,Fthe basis for her legacy.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/4
