OL,3,CHappy Birthday Beatrix Potter! 10
OL,4,Cfacts on the author's 160th birthday
OL,6,FHer most famous character, Peter
OL,7,FRabbit, started life in a letter to a
OL,8,Fsick child in 1893. She wrote and
OL,9,Fillustrated it to cheer the little boy
OL,10,Fup and it was so well received she
OL,11,Fwent on to self-publish a small run of
OL,12,Fcopies in 1901 before a publisher took
OL,13,Fit on.
OL,15,FIt has now sold more than 40 million
OL,16,Fcopies.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/4
