OL,3,CHappy Birthday Beatrix Potter! 10
OL,4,Cfacts on the author's 160th birthday
OL,6,FSet in the Lake District and often
OL,7,Fbased on real pets, thousands of
OL,8,Ftourists flock to the Lakes every year
OL,9,Fin her memory. She was in many ways a
OL,10,Fpioneer.
OL,12,FShe patented a Peter Rabbit Doll in
OL,13,F1903 making it one of the first
OL,14,Fliterary-inspired toys.
OL,16,FAway from writing she was a a talented
OL,17,Fscientist and farmer and a major
OL,18,Fbenefactor of the National Trust, to
OL,19,Fwhom she left most of her substantial
OL,20,Festate upon her death in 1943.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/4
